<http://www.semanticweb.org/reboots/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-4/BusTransport> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.semanticweb.org/reboots/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-4/Transport> ;
                                                                                        rdfs:comment "Public transport service using buses" ;
                                                                                        rdfs:label "BusTransport" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/reboots/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-4/BusinessHotel
<http://www.semanticweb.org/reboots/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-4/BusinessHotel> rdf:type owl:Class ;
