###  http://www.semanticweb.org/reboots/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-4/LuxuryHotel
<http://www.semanticweb.org/reboots/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-4/LuxuryHotel> rdf:type owl:Class ;
