                                                                                  rdfs:label "Museum" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/reboots/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-4/Park
<http://www.semanticweb.org/reboots/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-4/Park> rdf:type owl:Class ;
